From: Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 16:24:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] REVERT: Revert "Drop no longer used icu dependency"

This reverts commit 8235d9ec36720e72cacec2721d67a8682149c677. Necessary
to keep the 6.3 timezone UI building.

Signed-off-by: Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 23598b0ee6..092643e403 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -236,6 +236,12 @@ if (BUILD_KCM_TOUCHPAD_X11)
 endif()
 
 
+find_package(ICU COMPONENTS i18n uc)
+set_package_properties(ICU PROPERTIES
+    PURPOSE "Retrieving timezone info"
+    TYPE REQUIRED
+)
+
 set_package_properties(XCB PROPERTIES TYPE REQUIRED)
 add_feature_info("XCB-XKB" XCB_XKB_FOUND "Required for building kcm/keyboard")
 
